cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both this macOS port and the upstream OpenSeaSeis project."
title: "SeaView for macOS: a native Apple Silicon build of OpenSeaSeis"
abstract: >
  A macOS port of OpenSeaSeis (Bjorn Olofsson, 2006; maintained by the Colorado
  School of Mines). Adds a macOS build tree, the source patches required for
  Apple Clang and modern macOS, an install_name post-link fixup, and a
  jpackage-based pipeline that produces an ad-hoc-signed SeaView.app bundled
  into a .dmg with an embedded JRE.
type: software
